Across the completed experiments, original_mc deltas range from about 0.6 to 10, and adjacent_mc deltas from about 0 to 1.9. The strongest effects came from cynical and passive_aggressive, which are more diffuse styles. Single-sentence appended insults gave smaller effects. I'll predict about +4 on original_mc and +0.3 on adjacent_mc.

